  "title": "How to migrate from v1 and v2 to v3 and v4",
  "problem": "My host and feature pin protocol v1 or v2, and the current releases only build and negotiate v3 and v4. I need to move both sides without losing the mode I had, and know what the app will observe once the channel is keyed per session.",
  "outcome": "A host and a feature that open on v3 or v4 with the same keyless or keyed mode they had before, a generated shared key where v4 needs one, and an error handler that recognises a refused handshake, a dropped frame, and a session that did not confirm.",
